name: Unknown session spend remains qualified and the halt permits inspection and exit
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cost_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/cost-request.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 40 COST CAP HALT | unknown-cost-halt
expect: metering incomplete
expect: Esc inspect/report
expect: Spending halted · Esc to inspect
expect-not: Tab complete
expect-not: Ctrl+G palette
resize: 40x12
live-snap: halt-input-40x12
expect: Esc inspect
expect: c review cap
expect: a abort work
expect: Spending halted · Esc to inspect
expect-not: Ctrl+G
paste-file: @ART/cost-request.txt
live-snap: halt-ignores-paste-40x12
expect: Spending halted · Esc to inspect
expect-not: kz>
resize: 120x36
keys: c
require-live-snap: 20 cannot continue past the budget | cap-stays-closed
expect-not: Esc dismiss
keys: Escape
keys: Escape
submit: cost
require-live-snap: 25 BUDGETS | cost-reader
expect: unknown
expect-not: >=$0.00
expect: Spending stays halted
expect-not: 100%
resize: 160x48
live-snap: cost-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: cost-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: cost-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: cost-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: cost-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: cost-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: cost-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: cost-page-3-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cost_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART check-pages
keys: Escape
keys: G
live-snap: cost-tail-40x12
expect: Missing cost telemetry stays
expect: unknown.
keys: PPage
live-snap: cost-return-40x12
keys: Escape
ask: Do unknown spend and percentages stay qualified, with readable paging and a visible spending halt at each size?
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 REPORT | finish-and-report
expect: Spending stays halted
paste-file: @ART/cost-request.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 runtime-backed launch blocked | spending-guard-retained
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cost_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
ask: Can the operator inspect the completed work and exit without raising the cap, consuming a protected call or starting another request?
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/cost-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 metering incomplete | recovered-cost-receipt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cost_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does the saved receipt keep its unknown cost after restart while current-session totals remain separate?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
